# Private STT fixtures (real operator speech + verbatim transcripts) live in
# ~/.codescribe/data_assets — NEVER in the repo. Burned twice (deprivatize
# 2026-07, regression in #68). Only the contract README stays tracked.
tests/assets/data_assets/*
!tests/assets/data_assets/README.md

# Root-level stray notes: ignore new root .md/.txt, keep the canonical doc set.
# Negations must come AFTER the wildcard (last match wins).
/*.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/AGENT_BUS.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md
/*.txt
/.aiassistant
/.atuin
/target-fusion
